WEBVTT

00:05:29.369 --> 00:05:31.489
it won't get back to its intact state.

00:05:32.677 --> 00:05:36.958
So if we wanted to do a virginity check
on this hoop right here,

00:05:36.982 --> 00:05:38.242
right now,

00:05:38.266 --> 00:05:39.960
that would be very easy.

00:05:40.827 --> 00:05:46.295
It's easy to say that this hoop
is not a virgin anymore.

00:05:47.244 --> 00:05:48.520
(Laughter)

00:05:49.184 --> 00:05:52.605
NDB: But the hymen
is nothing like a piece of plastic

00:05:52.629 --> 00:05:54.635
you can wrap around your food,

00:05:54.659 --> 00:05:55.809
or a seal.

00:05:56.456 --> 00:05:57.656
In fact ...